cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the harmonised data table, please cite both the software (this repository / Zenodo DOI) and the accompanying article."
title: "UHI: Continuous Morphology Archetypes for Heat Mitigation Across Cities"
abstract: "Pipeline, configs, notebooks, and harmonised per-patch morphology-UHI table for the 66-city continuous-morphology study. Implements ingest, feature extraction, mixed-effects + XGBoost+SHAP attribution, empirical Pareto extraction, and morphology archetype clustering."
